                 "Lake of Rage?\r"
                 "He dreams about seeing the world’s\n"
                 "greatest MAGIKARP.\r"
                 "If you don’t mind, could you show him\n"
                 "any MAGIKARP you catch?\r"
                 "Who knows, you may catch the\n"
                 "MAGIKARP of his dreams.")
    end
